..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PACKPLAUSI.TVOL.FA
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Funktion       :
.. Functionality  :
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..  required relation between outer and inner sizes:
..
..      outer sizes                 inner sizes
..      ----------------------      ----------------------
..      tpacklge                >= tpacklgei
..      tpackbr                 >=  tpackbri
..      tpackhoe                >=  tpackhoei
..      tpackhoeklap ?
..      tvol                    >=  tvoli
..      ----------------------      ----------------------
..      .fo tvoli = tvol * tfuellgrad
..
..  calculate volume if lenght, width or heigt have been changed
.formula M|tvol  =  M|tpacklge /100 * M|tpackbr /100 * M|tpackhoe /100   ?  G|evtvar = "tpacklge"  ; G|evtvar = "tpackbr"  ; G|evtvar = "tpackhoe"
.formula M|tvoli =  M|tpacklgei/100 * M|tpackbri/100 * M|tpackhoei/100   ?  G|evtvar = "tpacklgei" ; G|evtvar = "tpackbri" ; G|evtvar = "tpackhoei"
.formula M|tvoli =  M|tpacklgei/100 * M|tpackbri/100 * M|tpackhoei/100   ?  G|evtvar = "tfuellgrad"
..
.. calculate usable volume
.formula M|tvoli =  M|tvoli *  M|tfuellgrad/100      ? _F|empty(M|tfuellgrad) & _F|empty(M|tvol)
..
..  check sizes..
.continue ERRLGE      ?  M|tpacklge  <  M|tpacklgei
.continue ERRBR       ?  M|tpackbr   <  M|tpackbri
.continue ERRHOE      ?  M|tpackhoe  <  M|tpackhoei
.continue ERRVOL      ?  M|tvol      <  M|tvoli
..
..
..  mark item as modified
.formula M|tbmark = true
.protection -reset tbmark 'M|aktzeile'  ?  M|tbmark = true
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..
..
!ERRLGE
!ERRBR
!ERRHOE
.error Die Innenmaáe drfen nicht gr”áer als die Auáenmaáe sein!
.end 1
..
!ERRVOL
.error Das Innenvolumen darf nicht gr”áer als das Auáenvolumen sein!
.end 1
